<前言><![CDATA[]]></前言>
<法規內容>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 1</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[This Standard is prescribed in accordance with Article 10 of the Charges and Fees Act.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 2</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The National Archives Administration, National Development Council (hereinafter referred to as the NAA) provides technical services, such as electronic records (or files) migration (or conversion), media destruction and so on, and these service charges are listed in Table Attached One. The relevant directions for applications are prescribed by the NAA separately.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 3</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The fees for the listed services of Article 2 shall be charged in accordance with this Standard. Applicants who apply for expedited service is available for an extra charge (as Table Attached One).]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 4</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[The standard for the provision of optional services other than those of Article 2 is listed in Table Attached Two.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 5</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[When data migration (or data conversion) process is unable to complete due to corrupted storage media, service fees shall be charged pro rata. However, this shall not apply to a case where the damage was detected prior to the data conversion.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 6</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[This Standard is handled in accordance with relevant provisions of the Charges and Fees Act, and shall be reviewed at least once every three years.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
  <條文>
    <條號>Article 7</條號>
    <條文內容><![CDATA[This Standard shall come into force from the date of promulgation.]]></條文內容>
  </條文>
</法規內容>
</法規>
